  "prefLabel": "Ins 3902.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 3902.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to permit the sale of individual supplementary insurance against the loss of income due to the involuntary loss of employment and to establish standards governing such coverage.\n\nSource. #10863, eff 8-1-15; ss by #14507, eff 2-7-26, EXPIRES: 2-7-36",
